                <pb facs="0812" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg710"/>

                <head>Extradition treaty between the United States and the Republic of San
                    Marino</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Rome, January 10, 1906.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate, April 17, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, May 7, 1908. Ratified by Republic of San Marino, February 19,
                        1906. Ratifications exchanged at Rome, June 8, 1908. Proclaimed, June 12,
                        1908.</hi></p>

